  "goodToKnow": "Der Schadstoff is a pollutant or harmful substance: Schadstoffe in der Luft, im Wasser, in Lebensmitteln. Cars are grouped by Schadstoffklasse, and many cities have Umweltzonen that only cars with a green Feinstaubplakette (emissions sticker) may enter. Schadstoffarm means low-emission. From der Schaden (harm) and der Stoff (substance). Plural: die Schadstoffe."
